WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Ryu’s OD Shoryuken rises short of Lily at the recorded spacing.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.100
Raw-Rush back heavy punch punishes the recovery.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.950
Crouching heavy punch extends the opening punish.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.500
The first cancel Rush links back heavy punch to standing medium kick.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.550
The second cancel Rush enters burnout and links jab to crouching heavy punch.

6
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.150
Medium Condor Wind leads into Level 3 and gains a Wind stock.

7
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.950
Raging Typhoon spends all three Super stocks.

8
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.200
Ryu remains down after the cash-out.
